# Keep the Vercel deploy lean — these are never needed to build/serve the API.
# excludeFiles (vercel.json) trims the function bundle; this trims the upload.

# DuckDB: the live 157 MB DB exceeds Vercel's 100 MB per-file upload cap, and
# the API now restores it from Cloudflare R2 at runtime (see duckdb_store.py
# _bootstrap_db_from_r2 — restores into the writable /tmp on serverless).
# Exclude the live DB AND its backups so the upload stays small.
**/data/mandi_iq.duckdb
**/data/mandi_iq.duckdb.pre_fix_backup
**/data/mandi_iq.duckdb.backup
**/*.backup

# Repomix dumps (~41 MB of generated markdown/XML)
**/repomix*

# Not needed by the API
archive/
demo/
worker/
landing/
docs/
scripts/
tests/
test_output/
**/screenshots/

# Tooling / VCS
.git/
.vercel/
.streamlit/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/node_modules/
